        "detail": "• May 10: Sponsor outreach list deadline relaxed to Thursday; outreach strategy overview to be given at Thursday meeting.\n• May 11: The first Business Plan draft was completed; WWTP was assigned as primary research focus.\n• May 11: Early business plan draft (PetaScale_1st_Draft_Business_Plan.pdf) shared ahead of WWTP feasibility conversations.\n• May 13: PetaScale won the UATECH Vancouver pitch, securing $25K in AWS credits.\n• May 14: The team pitched at WebSummit and won $25K in AWS credits.\n• May 16: Michael Pak shares Newfoundland & Labrador WWTP database and PDF listing."
