        "detail": "• Jun 8: The Dry Lab reel was done with Hardware content next; logo redesign feedback was collected.\n• Jun 8: Anthony was confirmed for the promo video voice-over; a newsletter draft was due June 20.\n• Jun 8: Kara was confirmed as the Plastic Conference keynote, allowing the conference date to be locked.\n• Jun 8: Dry Lab reel content was filmed and Hardware content set as the focus for the next two weeks; Anthony was confirmed for the promo video voice-over.\n• Jun 8: Logo redesign feedback was collected (different colour for the i, white in the i dot, blue scissors to match the PET molecule); a paid Instagram ad was planned for conference promotion.\n• Jun 10: Wiki plan calls for a sky-themed section with petamon flying around the team logo; team discusses giving a winged/sky-themed petamon to a subteam.\n• Jun 10: Human Practices petamon concept proposed: dove-like wings tied to an ethics/peace theme; first sketch work begins."
