        "detail": "• Sep 21: All wiki subtabs were set due to Purav by end of week, with each lead to send a subtab list and description.\n• Sep 21: Web was collecting subteam wiki content and building more homepage animation.\n• Sep 21: Every lead was asked to send Purav their wiki subtab list with one-line descriptions by end of week.\n• Sep 21: Web entered content intake mode, integrating subteam content as folders appeared, with more homepage animation in progress.\n• Sep 22: Anthony Dinglasan shares the finalized Venture wiki outline doc and the content drive folder; expects content finalization by Oct 9.\n• Sep 22: The wiki freeze date was found inconsistent (Oct 21 cited by announcements and Venture, Oct 28 by Dry Lab) and flagged for reconciliation.\n• Sep 22: Purav rallied the team to actively target the Best Wiki special award.\n• Sep 25: Website fixes were applied, resolving the homepage stat contradiction (485 alumni, 21 teams) and copy nits, and folding in the team feedback-form responses."
